<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,377 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,377 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged down to 5,377 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,376 on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Sept 17		 Sept 16</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,377		   5,376</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)  5.16		    4.04</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
